Package: clinicalUtils
Title: Reusable Utilities for Clinical Programming
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Clinical R Framework", "Maintainers", email = "maintainers@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Dependency-light derivation, data-quality validation, synthetic dataset,
    and regression comparison utilities for clinical programming workflows.
    Checks are configurable and are not a substitute for approved standards
    conformance or regulatory validation software.
